        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 150_000\n    index_rate = 0.02\n    margin = 0.015\n    remaining_months = 10 * 12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    annual_rate = index_rate + margin\n    monthly_rate = annual_rate / 12\n    payment = principal * monthly_rate * (1 + monthly_rate) ** remaining_months / (\n        (1 + monthly_rate) ** remaining_months - 1\n    )\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest cent\n    return round(payment, 2)\n```",
